"Height":397}],"Id":1911645,"PostDate":1457411402,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I've finally unpacked and have gone through all of my wedding items ...2 months later (lol don't judge <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> )<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are the items I'm selling:\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>*I would prefer to sell locally in Toronto but willing to ship (buyer pays shipping cost)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Mr. & Mrs. Chalkboard Signs <\/strong>$15\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911645]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-46859100-1457405592.jpg\" title=\"12795400_10156541710880366_2277213411665394117_n.jpg - Size: 15.51KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-46859100-1457405592.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"12795400_10156541710880366_2277213411665394117_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Alcohol Sign <\/strong>$10<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911645]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-95916900-1457405848.jpg\" title=\"12472547_10156541706715366_8537022236762415788_n.jpg - Size: 49.99KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-95916900-1457405848.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"12472547_10156541706715366_8537022236762415788_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bride Tank<\/strong> $10 (gently used once)<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911645]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-08460200-1457406166.jpg\" title=\"12688389_10156454952830366_4479396707422504655_n.jpg - Size: 32KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-08460200-1457406166.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"12688389_10156454952830366_4479396707422504655_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911645]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-85190600-1457406186.jpg\" title=\"12705614_10156454953980366_1830928869994128185_n.jpg - Size: 28.1KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-85190600-1457406186.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"12705614_10156454953980366_1830928869994128185_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>2 Sarongs<\/strong> (new still in the package) $15 for both<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911645]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-94523600-1457407124.png\" title=\"sarongs.PNG - Size: 159.36KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-94523600-1457407124.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"sarongs.PNG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1415551111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1455040720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.54.29.147","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79983,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by snswedding2016, 07 March 2016 - 10:35 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1457418939,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a6f02ba4bda0435cd612846737f4314","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;...for some reason a bunch of my text deleted from my previous post. Here are the other items.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bride Robe&lt;\/strong&gt; $20 (never worn, tags still on)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Roll of Blue Tulle&lt;\/strong&gt; $5&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Magnets&lt;\/strong&gt; $5 (4 used out of a pack of 50)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Twine&lt;\/strong&gt; (various blues) $5 (for all)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-2 packs partially used&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-1 pack unopened&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6 LED Candles&lt;\/strong&gt; $12 (for all)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-unopened&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;65 Small Clear Resealable Bags&lt;\/strong&gt; $2&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-Perfect for OOT bags for meds or Q-Tips etc&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Items to Rent &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;(I have a bunch of items that I would like to keep but would rent out to local brides in Toronto):&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;*Rates are negotiable&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4 Strands of String Lights &lt;\/strong&gt;- $10\/per strand\/per weekly rental&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-25 bulbs &amp;amp; 28ft per strand&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-Green cord&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-Clear Globe Bulbs&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-Packs into a medium sized box for transport&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;9 Small Blue Paper Lanterns&lt;\/strong&gt; - $10\/per weekly rental (for all 9)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;9 Medium LED Candles &lt;\/strong&gt;- $10\/per weekly rental (for all 9)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;28 Small Votive LED Candles&lt;\/strong&gt; - $15\/per weekly rental (for all 28)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5 Pillar LED Candles &lt;\/strong&gt;(different sizes, the 5 are a set)- $10\/per weekly rental (for all 5)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Stamps (free to borrow):\n\n-&lt;strong&gt;Travel Set&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-&lt;strong&gt;2 Alphabet Sets &lt;\/strong&gt;(different sizes)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911646,"PostDate":1457420094,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>...for some reason a bunch of my text deleted from my previous post. Here are the other items.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bride Robe<\/strong> $20 (never worn, tags still on)<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911646]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-05187600-1457414856.png\" title=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 10.48.09 PM.png - Size: 314.07KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-05187600-1457414856.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 10.48.09 PM.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>A Roll of Blue Tulle<\/strong> $5<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911646]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-76870700-1457414897.png\" title=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 10.47.11 PM.png - Size: 475.04KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-76870700-1457414897.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 10.47.11 PM.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Magnets<\/strong> $5 (4 used out of a pack of 50)<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911646]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-05521600-1457414936.png\" title=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 11.29.21 PM.png - Size: 458.19KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-05521600-1457414936.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 11.29.21 PM.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Twine<\/strong> (various blues) $5 (for all)<\/p>\n<p>-2 packs partially used<\/p>\n<p>-1 pack unopened\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911646]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-79641000-1457415023.png\" title=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 11.29.31 PM.png - Size: 597.52KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-79641000-1457415023.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 11.29.31 PM.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>6 LED Candles<\/strong> $12 (for all)<\/p>\n<p>-unopened\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911646]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-49412200-1457415118.png\" title=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 11.29.52 PM.png - Size: 386.75KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-49412200-1457415118.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 11.29.52 PM.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>65 Small Clear Resealable Bags<\/strong> $2<\/p>\n<p>-Perfect for OOT bags for meds or Q-Tips etc<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911646]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-21667400-1457415238.png\" title=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 11.30.22 PM.png - Size: 409.51KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-21667400-1457415238.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 11.30.22 PM.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<br \/><p><u><strong>Items to Rent <\/strong><\/u>(I have a bunch of items that I would like to keep but would rent out to local brides in Toronto):\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>*Rates are negotiable<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>4 Strands of String Lights <\/strong>- $10\/per strand\/per weekly rental<\/p>\n<p>-25 bulbs & 28ft per strand<\/p>\n<p>-Green cord<\/p>\n<p>-Clear Globe Bulbs<\/p>\n<p>-Packs into a medium sized box for transport<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911646]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-42789000-1457415727.jpg\" title=\"12803257_10156541710080366_7511265157457754351_n.jpg - Size: 94.3KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-42789000-1457415727.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"12803257_10156541710080366_7511265157457754351_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911646]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-43951400-1457415743.jpg\" title=\"12644965_10156454946275366_7002772567100421426_n.jpg - Size: 107.45KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-43951400-1457415743.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"12644965_10156454946275366_7002772567100421426_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>9 Small Blue Paper Lanterns<\/strong> - $10\/per weekly rental (for all 9)<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911646]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-54831700-1457415792.jpg\" title=\"12669424_10156454948430366_7438213844291832633_n.jpg - Size: 77.19KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-54831700-1457415792.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"12669424_10156454948430366_7438213844291832633_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>9 Medium LED Candles <\/strong>- $10\/per weekly rental (for all 9)<\/p>\n<p><strong>28 Small Votive LED Candles<\/strong> - $15\/per weekly rental (for all 28)\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911646]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-75482600-1457416196.jpg\" title=\"12814570_10156541708760366_6057555529433904634_n.jpg - Size: 11.66KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-75482600-1457416196.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"12814570_10156541708760366_6057555529433904634_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>5 Pillar LED Candles <\/strong>(different sizes, the 5 are a set)- $10\/per weekly rental (for all 5)<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911646]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-03686100-1457416308.jpg\" title=\"12715712_10156454961115366_6502904693660437698_n.jpg - Size: 58.5KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-03686100-1457416308.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"12715712_10156454961115366_6502904693660437698_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911646]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-91117700-1457416332.jpg\" title=\"12654381_10156454958345366_1166510778684198323_n.jpg - Size: 50.78KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-91117700-1457416332.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"12654381_10156454958345366_1166510778684198323_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Stamps (free to borrow):<br>\n-<strong>Travel Set<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911646]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-74146100-1457416397.png\" title=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 10.47.23 PM.png - Size: 479.03KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-74146100-1457416397.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 10.47.23 PM.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-<strong>2 Alphabet Sets <\/strong>(different sizes)<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1911646]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-51761200-1457416433.png\" title=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 11.30.10 PM.png - Size: 364.37KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-281055-0-51761200-1457416433.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 11.30.10 PM.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1415551111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1455040720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.142.4.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79983,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6929393b081deeff8154df6d6f822b68","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;No judgement here!! I definitely did the same thing. Cool! I didn&#039;t know that you brought those string lights. What a great idea!!! I should have done that! hahah&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911651,"PostDate":1457455541,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>No judgement here!! I definitely did the same thing. Cool! I didn't know that you brought those string lights. What a great idea!!! I should have done that! hahah<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419441414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.53.254.39","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79983,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by snswedding2016, 08 March 2016 - 09:01 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1457456482,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d4190d455ad4af8b5b3a5dc6b11032e0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] the rental through lomas was crazy expensive for lights and I found a good black friday deal. Actually they were the first things I purchased for the wedding! LOL! They worked out perfectly! I planned for 3 strands and had one extra just in case. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911652,"PostDate":1457456462,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> the rental through lomas was crazy expensive for lights and I found a good black friday deal. Actually they were the first things I purchased for the wedding! LOL! They worked out perfectly! I planned for 3 strands and had one extra just in case. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1415551111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1455040720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.142.4.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79983,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c2b4bebe88ca0be1417ac90cfb97d28e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s amazing. I wanted the draped string light style, but LatinAsia and Zuniga were crazy expensive too. My lighting still worked out but the extra lighting would have been great. What a great idea to bring them yourself!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911653,"PostDate":1457457571,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That's amazing. I wanted the draped string light style, but LatinAsia and Zuniga were crazy expensive too. My lighting still worked out but the extra lighting would have been great. What a great idea to bring them yourself!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419441414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.53.254.39","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79983,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b44cd291c14095b0b325237ee162023d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] your lighting was gorgeous! If you ever renew your vows and need string lights...you know where to find me! ;)&amp;nbsp; We also thought they would be nice to have for our deck for summer BBQs or random parties. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911654,"PostDate":1457459121,"PostContent":"